The proposed system follows this workflow:

Solar panels generate electrical energy.
A solar charge controller manages battery charging.
The battery stores generated energy.
Sensors monitor voltage and current.
An ESP32/Arduino-based controller evaluates available energy.
Priority rules determine the distribution of available power.
An LCD/OLED display provides system status and alerts.

System Flow:

Solar Panel → Charge Controller → Battery → Energy Monitoring → Priority Controller → Selected Loads
